# UI/UX Best Practices

## Visual Hierarchy
- Larger = more important
- Font sizes: 12-14px body, 16-20px headings, 24-32px titles
- Weight: 400 regular, 500 medium, 600-700 headings
- Spacing: 4px, 8px, 16px, 24px, 32px, 48px (multiples of 4)
- Colors: 3 max per screen (primary, secondary, accent)

## Interaction
- Buttons: min 44x44px touch target
- Hover states: color/bg change, not just cursor
- Active states: scale(0.98) or darker shade
- Disabled: opacity-50, cursor-not-allowed
- Loading: spinner + "Loading..." text
- Feedback: toast/alert on actions (success/error)

## Forms
- Labels above inputs
- Placeholder ≠ label (use both)
- Show password toggle
- Inline validation (after blur)
- Error messages: red, below field, specific
- Auto-focus first field
- Enter submits form

## Accessibility
- Contrast: 4.5:1 text, 3:1 UI elements
- Focus visible (ring-2 ring-blue-500)
- aria-label on icon buttons
- alt text on images
- Semantic HTML: button not div
- Keyboard: Tab, Enter, Escape work
- Skip to main content link

## Responsive
- Mobile-first design
- Breakpoints: sm:640 md:768 lg:1024 xl:1280
- Touch targets: 44px minimum
- Avoid hover-only interactions
- Test on real devices

## Performance UX
- Skeleton screens for loading (not spinners alone)
- Optimistic UI updates
- Images: lazy load, blur placeholder
- Instant feedback (<100ms)
- Page load: <3s perceived

## Layout
- Max width: 1280px centered
- Content width: 600-800px for reading
- White space: generous (not cramped)
- Consistent padding: 16px mobile, 24px desktop
- Grid: 12 columns or flexbox

## Typography
- Line height: 1.5 body, 1.2 headings
- Line length: 50-75 characters
- Font stack: system fonts or 1-2 web fonts max
- Readable contrast (no light gray on white)

## Navigation
- Logo links to home
- Max 5-7 top nav items
- Active page highlighted
- Breadcrumbs for deep pages
- Sticky header or back-to-top

## CTAs (Call to Action)
- Primary action: bold, contrasting color
- One primary CTA per screen
- Action words: "Get Started", "Download", not "Submit"
- Position: top-right or bottom-center

## Feedback & Errors
- Success: green checkmark + message
- Error: red X + specific fix ("Email required")
- Warning: yellow alert
- Info: blue icon
- Auto-dismiss non-critical (3-5s)

## Avoid
- Tiny text (<12px)
- Low contrast (<4.5:1)
- Hidden navigation (hamburger on desktop)
- Auto-playing videos
- Pop-ups on entry
- Infinite scroll without pagination option
- Centering everything
- ALL CAPS body text